...@house-style
shape: sequence_diagram

# A `sign` request, end to end. The private key never crosses back to the
# normal world; only the public key and the r||s signature do, and the
# development host verifies them with an independent crypto library.

dev: Development host
client: signer-client
tee: OP-TEE
ta: signer TA

dev -> client: sign <64-hex digest>
client -> tee: OpenSession(UUID)
tee -> ta: load + open session
client -> tee: InvokeCommand(Sign, digest in, 64 B out)
tee -> ta: dispatch
ta -> ta: load key from secure storage
ta -> ta: ECDSA P-256 over the digest
ta -> client: r || s
client -> dev: JSON — pubkey, digest, signature
dev -> dev: verify.py — independent check
